{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mQmSMBUU4r1795409051.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>錢嘉樂、陳曉華及阮浩棕日前（22日）為TVB大型慈善籌款節目《歡樂滿東華2026》表演項目「飛車遊繩特技」進行綵排，分頭備戰高空與地面特技動作。</p><p></p><p>綵排期間，陳曉華吊威也升至15米高空，化身「空中女飛人」挑戰高空旋轉動作；而阮浩棕則以一身紅、白、黑賽車服亮相，化身型格賽車手。阮浩棕接受傳媒訪問時透露，正式演出當晚將會與錢嘉樂緊密配合完成項目，並預告屆時會挑戰高難度動作「跳火圈」，令人對正式演出倍感期待。</p><p><p><img alt=\"92f3cd2a-cdb6-4a3d-b003-652a8bb897e6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zR0WswJjJd1795409065.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f30e21ac-22e2-4da9-8132-2a5bb12f93b1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GDWSzUO1xz1795409058.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"40dd834d-163f-456e-88b8-c7e76cf2b404.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bDJ2O9FSWG1795409073.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f400e92b-ecf7-416b-ab27-5ecd266d376f.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZFsG7lGJ6o1795409079.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:50:39.324021+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T17:11:27.626325+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:44:05.954036+00:00","content_hash":"165bb4a0ba46448ca8b3ada5ade2a1bca2894248747075c6fc8cc78ef6f90e10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:50:39.324021+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}